abstract: >-
  Open-source multi-scale Martian terrain verification middleware, static data
  pack, and interactive EVA survival guide confronting orbital slope models
  (1 m, 4 m, 16 m, 64 m) against 708 ground-truth Perseverance rover tilt
  measurements in Jezero Crater.
